#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "StyleSwitch"
msgstr ""

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
msgid "https://iiic.dev/style-switch"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
msgid "A widget that lets visitors switch the site between a light and a dark color scheme. Built on the StyleSwitch library: alternate style sheets, prefers-color-scheme and a cookie with the visitor's choice."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "ic"
msgstr ""

#. Author URI of the plugin
msgid "https://iiic.dev/"
msgstr ""

